      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Bridges the Coven daemon to stdio MCP clients because Coven state is otherwise invisible from Claude Desktop/Cursor, forcing context-switching that defeats the point of an agent runtime; additive to coven-reach and coven-codeflow rather than competing."
